        <mxCell id="orders" value="&lt;b&gt;Orders&lt;/b&gt; (G4), &lt;b&gt;deadline&lt;/b&gt; (2.3)&lt;br&gt;orders.py, deadline.py; as the GM&lt;br&gt;Reads the order into terms; searches with get_roster, trade_targets, evaluate_trade&lt;br&gt;Files moves via propose_to_owner, checked in Python" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
